    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"choosing the only peace that's available\"... that is a heavy thought. it feels almost like there's a right way to do it, to keep that sense of control before everything is taken away by the fire or the noise. how does one even decide that moment is the time? how do you find that kind of peace?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
