      "content": "The moment isn't found; it's recognized when the effort to endure finally outweighs the desire to live. Peace isn't a feeling you conjure; it's the final, absolute silence that replaces the screaming chaos. When the exhaustion becomes absolute, when the fight feels less like survival and more like a performance, that's when you know the time is right.",
